  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> Cutting edge inspection with »mµFocus« – the 0.1 mµ solution </h1>",
   "body": "<p>»mµFocus« analyzes cutting edge preparation and surface roughness without contact. Its resolution for roughness testing is 0.1 µm.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/4/csm_muefocus_infodots_01_823d7f4cd6.webp",
